<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/38/eng@/~cl_15> <https://schema.org/text> "Any compounding of offences under the existing section 24 of the principal Act which is pending immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on or after the coming into operation of this Act, continue to be valid and shall be dealt with under section 24 of the principal Act as if section 24 had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/38/eng@> .
